  "historyNote": "#4384, eff 3-10-88, ss by #4562, eff 1-3-89; amd by #5862, eff 7-1-94; amd by #5936, INTERIM, eff 1-3-95, EXPIRES, 5-3-95 (formerly Saf-C 408.09); ss by #6005, eff 3-24-95; amd by #6092, eff 9-19-95; paragraphs (a), (b), (d) and subparagraphs (c)(1) EXPIRED: 3-24-95; amd by #7904, INTERIM, eff 6-24-03, EXPIRED: 12-21-03 New. #8172, eff 9-21-04 (from Saf-C 403.08); ss by #10293, eff 3-20-13",
